{
    "version": "0.1.6-nightly.13",
    "description": "Your Android phone and your PC, working as one. Windows and Linux. Local-first, end-to-end encrypted, no account.",
    "homepage": "https://github.com/thtbee/nectarlink",
    "license": "NOASSERTION",
    "checkver": {
        "github": "https://github.com/thtbee/nectarlink",
        "tag_regex": "^v(\\d+\\.\\d+\\.\\d+-nightly\\.\\d+)$"
    },
    "architecture": {
        "64bit": {
            "url": "https://github.com/thtbee/nectarlink/releases/download/v0.1.6-nightly.13/Nectarlink-0.1.6-nightly.13-x64-setup.exe",
            "hash": "sha256:c8735af562f7fbcdd8bcb4e770c420638ce15d87493519863894a188252e96c3"
        },
        "arm64": {
            "url": "https://github.com/thtbee/nectarlink/releases/download/v0.1.6-nightly.13/Nectarlink-0.1.6-nightly.13-arm64-setup.exe",
            "hash": "sha256:e8f73bf741b3f4262ab91909ea535bab4b799f045e868f1c7ad74b874d3ade89"
        }
    },
    "autoupdate": {
        "architecture": {
            "64bit": {
                "url": "https://github.com/thtbee/nectarlink/releases/download/v$version/Nectarlink-$version-x64-setup.exe"
            },
            "arm64": {
                "url": "https://github.com/thtbee/nectarlink/releases/download/v$version/Nectarlink-$version-arm64-setup.exe"
            }
        }
    },
    "bin": "$_2_\\nectarlink-desktop.exe",
    "shortcuts": [
        [
            "$_2_\\nectarlink-desktop.exe",
            "nectarlink"
        ]
    ],
    "pre_install": [
        "Expand-7zipArchive (Get-ChildItem \"$dir\\*.exe\" | Select-Object -First 1).FullName \"$dir\\_extract\"",
        "$__app7z = Get-ChildItem \"$dir\\_extract\" -Recurse -Filter 'app-*.7z' | Select-Object -First 1",
        "if ($__app7z) { Expand-7zipArchive $__app7z.FullName \"$dir\"; Remove-Item \"$dir\\_extract\" -Recurse -Force } else { Move-Item \"$dir\\_extract\\*\" \"$dir\" -Force; Remove-Item \"$dir\\_extract\" -Recurse -Force }"
    ],
    "notes": [
        "上游只发 nightly 预发布（stable 停在 0.1.5），checkver 用 tag_regex 锁定 nightly 通道，避免 CI 降级到 stable。",
        "NSIS 安装包由 pre_install 解包（$_2_/$PLUGINSDIR 为 NSIS 内部变量目录，bin/shortcuts 按实测路径指向）。"
    ]
}
